@model bool
@*
    The apply button, or nothing (D43). It is in the navbar rather than on each page because
    "Asterisk is running config older than the database" is true of the whole system, not of the
    page you happen to be looking at, and because a button that is only there when there is
    something to do needs no explaining.
*@
@if (Model)
{
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-danger" onclick="pbx.applyConfig(this)"
            title="The configuration has changed since the last apply. This writes it to Asterisk and reloads what changed.">
        Apply config
    </button>
}
